%% MUPP-077 Gifts added by visitors
flowchart TD
    A[Visitor opens the wish list] --> B[Presses Lägg till at the end of the list]
    B --> C[Step 1: the gift]
    C --> D{Fields valid? R2}
    D -- no --> E[Error on the field, stay on step 1]
    E --> C
    D -- yes --> F[Step 2: Ange ditt namn]
    F -- back arrow --> C
    F --> G{Name given? R3}
    G -- no --> H[Skriv ditt namn.]
    H --> F
    G -- yes --> I{Site session, guardWrite, child and occasion, limit of 20? R7}
    I -- no --> J[Error in the window, nothing saved]
    I -- yes --> K[Row saved as claimed and added by the visitor R4]
    K --> L[Tillagd av name in the list, admin and archive R4 R6]
    L --> M[Undo arrow R5]
    M --> N[Ta bort paxningen: row stays unclaimed]
    M --> O[Ta bort presenten: row deleted]
